1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,480
I feel ungrateful when I tell
my family what I want.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,480
Private reflection first.
Arjun can correct it.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,480
He starts unsure
what he needs.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,480
No model is connected;
reply is prepared.

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,480
His words stay separate
from a possible meaning.

6
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:23,480
He rejects that possibility.

7
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,480
He names what was missed,
in his own words.

8
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,480
The local reflection changes
to fit his correction.

9
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:35,480
Muse Spark could suggest a theme
for Arjun to correct.

10
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,480
Confirmed themes could guide
prepared story searches.

11
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:43,480
Fixed browser rules;
no live model search.

12
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:47,480
Broad results dropped;
family pressure stays.

13
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:51,480
He chooses the family community.

14
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:55,480
Ravi is fictional;
prepared story.

15
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:59,480
Their shared point is
family pressure.

16
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:03,480
Ravi had a trusted friend;
Arjun has not said that.

17
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:07,480
Group question;
no DMs.

18
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:11,480
He asks for time to decide
before answering.

19
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:15,480
Group and alias shown;
no DM.

20
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:19,480
Consent unchecked.
Cancel sends nothing.

21
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:23,480
Maybe later;
reflection stays private.

22
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:27,480
He keeps one note,
only for this session.
